{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "開いてくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡県出身\n櫻坂46 大沼晶保です🐟🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いよいよ明日から\nツアーが始まりますね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさん準備出来てますか〜〜〜？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初日7月23日と24日は\n静岡公演です🐟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobTpyFRF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "地元静岡で櫻坂のライブが行われること\n夢だったのでとっても嬉しいです✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesのみなさんを\nいっぱい笑顔に出来るよう頑張ります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もし2日間参戦してくださる方や\nお時間に余裕がある方は！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡には魅力的な所がいっぱいなので\nぜひ観光してほしいな꒰ˆ‎o̴̶̷ ⩊ o̴̶̷‪‪ˆ꒱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🍵エコパアリーナ周辺や、向かう途中だと🍵"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱり定番は\n「炭火焼きレストランさわやか」さん\nのげんこつハンバーグ✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobAHiOCf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡に来ないと食べられない\n超大人気店です！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も大好きです♡\n特に妹は実家に帰る度に\n必ず行くくらい愛しています笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブ会場の近く掛川にも店舗があるのでぜひ！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かなり混むので早めに行って整理券をとったり\n時間に余裕を持って行くことをおすすめします☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🥟浜松餃子"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浜松餃子は野菜が多めで甘みがあって、何個でも食べられるくらいあっさりしています！\n私も大好きで、知り合いがよく冷凍の浜松餃子を買ってきてくれるので、大沼家で食べる餃子は浜松餃子が定番です🥟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時間があったらぜひ！\nお土産にも冷凍浜松餃子おすすめです🥟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "☁️三島スカイウォーク"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごーく時間に余裕がある方はぜひ！\n三島駅から30分バスに乗ったら着きます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobyYJXKA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日本で一番長い吊り橋です✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "晴れていると富士山や駿河湾のすっごくきれいな絶景が見れます！\nロングジップスライドというアクティビティが出来たり静岡のグルメがたくさん食べられます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は高校3年生の夏休みに三島スカイウォークさんでほぼ毎日バイトさせていただいて、\n毎日通勤で朝この橋を渡っていました🏃‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に自然に癒されるので\nBuddiesのみなさんにオススメしたいです☁️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとついこの間ほのちゃんれいちゃんも\n「満天☆青空レストラン」さんで来ていて\n聖地巡礼出来ちゃいます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時間に余裕があって\n天候に恵まれていたらぜひおすすめです☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他にもしらす丼や桜えび、海鮮丼もおすすめです！！🐟\n静岡ならではの新鮮な海の幸を、ぜひ味わってもらいたいです〜☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesのみなさんに\nライブと一緒に静岡も楽しんでいただけたら\n嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遅くなってしまいましたが、\n先日のリアルミーグリin幕張メッセありがとうございました₍ᐢ.ˬ.ᐢ₎✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobOGRW0o.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スポーティーな白ワンピースにしてみたよ〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobO9wrdQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob9YAzQ1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おだんご出来たー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobWfOAcS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い祝花たち〜いつも本当にありがとう！\nいつも一枚一枚写真撮って見返してるよ〜.⋆𝜗𝜚.†⋆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobzvmnqa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣姿あいりんじも可愛い！！！💙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはオンラインミーグリの時の〜！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobxcLQhS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobmrIBuQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobk7AKLo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobfMG2Zf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都リアルミーグリもﾀﾉｼﾐﾀﾞʕ•ᴥ•ʔ♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは初日一緒に盛り上がろうね〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あきぽ🐟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたは191cm沼にはまりました"}], "source": "official"}